				<guid>https://marcel5751.github.io/2021/06/21/using-marp-cli-in-a-docker-container/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Recently, I had the idea for a tool, that converts a CSV file into a &lt;a href=&#34;https://marpit.marp.app/&#34;&gt;Marp&lt;/a&gt; markdown slides, which can subsequently be converted into a pdf file. The goal was to be able to work on multiple-choice quizzes with friends using e.g. google docs, then export the sheet as CSV and quickly generate slides for a quiz night.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
